  m_Name: Faction_Hegemony
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: KryticalNova.Runtime::KryticalNova.Factions.FactionDefinition
  id: 1
  displayName: Hegemony
  tagline: Civilization must endure.
  lore: 'The Hegemony is the civilization that learned to catch souls before they return to Nova. Captured soul energy powers its cities, its weapons and the mechanical workers that built them, and millions live on what it provides. Run by corporate elites and enforced by heavily armored void-marines, it used its machines as disposable labor, and when its extraction reached the ancestral wildlands it treated the people there with the same clinical indifference: living souls were fuel. Its answer to Nova''s wound is necessity. Give up soul energy and the cities go dark, so it must be controlled, not abandoned.'
  crest: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d451406eb7b65346a9a7ec52fe74601, type: 3}
